# ReactWoo Geo Core

- **Platform / Cloud plan:** `docs/architecture/` (v1 architecture + work packages)
- **Geo Core phases:** `docs/geo-core-cursor-master-plan.md`
- **Workflow note:** `docs/AGENTS.md` (single-thread default)
- **Phase notes:** `docs/phases/` (e.g. `phase-1.md`)
- **Always-on:** `.cursor/rules/reactwoo-platform.mdc`

## Rules

- Geo Core owns shared platform infrastructure (capability registry, decision runtime, slots, entitlements). Satellites register capabilities; do not create independent decision engines.
- Geo Core owns context, rules, variants, fallback; extend with adapters, no big-bang rewrites.
- New geo-related admin UI must align with **GeoElementor** patterns (see master plan §5).
- **No CSV / free-typed country lists in user-facing UIs** — use prepopulated selectable controls (master plan §5.1).
- AI / licensing: `https://api.reactwoo.com` and `https://license.reactwoo.com` only — no direct OpenAI in plugins for product AI (master plan §6).
- Prefer `RWGC_Routing::get_route_decision_for_page()` and `rwgc_get_page_route_decision()` over duplicating routing logic.
